Standard Open Phase Input File
!!!All values in MKS units!!!

@RunTimeControl
$SimulationTitle       Simulation Title             : 2D polycrystalline PVD with vapor transport
$MaxTimeStep           Number of Time Steps         : 20000
$VTKOutputInterval     Output to disk interval      : 500
$ConsoleOutputInterval Output to screen interval    : 500
$UnitsOfLength         Units of length              : m
$UnitsOfTime           Units of time                : s
$UnitsOfMass           Units of mass                : kg
$UnitsOfEnergy         Energy units                 : J
$dt                    Initial Time Step            : 1.0e-8
$OpenMPThreads         Number of OpenMP Threads     : 1
$RestartSwitch         Restart switch (Yes/No)      : No
$StartTimeStep         Start at time step           : 0
$CheckpointInterval    Restart output interval      : 5000

@GridParameters
$Nx       System Size in X Direction                : 192
$Ny       System Size in Y Direction                : 128
$Nz       System Size in Z Direction                : 0
$dx       Grid Spacing                              : 2.0e-9
$IWidth   Interface Width (in grid points)          : 5.0
$Bcells   Boundary cells                            : 2

@Settings
$Comp_0   Chemical component 0                      : DepositedMaterial
$Phase_0  Name of phase 0                           : Vapor
$State_0  Aggregate state of phase 0                : Gas
$Phase_1  Name of phase 1                           : Film
$State_1  Aggregate state of phase 1                : Solid
$MassDensity_0 Equilibrium density of vapor         : 1.0
$MassDensity_1 Equilibrium density of film          : 5000.0

@DrivingForce
# Directional deposition is already local; turning averaging off prevents the
# incidence-angle field from being smeared along the interface.  Average() is
# still called by Python because it also initializes OpenPhase's pair weights.
$Average        Driving force averaging             : No
$Limiting       Driving force limiting              : Yes
$Limit_0_1      Driving force cutoff 0 1            : 0.50

@InterfaceProperties
$EnergyModel_0_0    Interface energy model          : Iso
$EnergyModel_0_1    Interface energy model          : Iso
$EnergyModel_1_1    Interface energy model          : Iso
$Sigma_0_0          Interface energy                : 0.0
$Sigma_0_1          Vapor-film interface energy     : 1.0
$Sigma_1_1          Grain-boundary energy           : 0.50
$ExtrapolationMode  Interface-property extrapolation: FirstOrder

$MobilityModel_0_0  Interface mobility model        : Iso
$MobilityModel_0_1  Interface mobility model        : Iso
$MobilityModel_1_1  Interface mobility model        : Iso
$Mu_0_0             Interface mobility              : 0.0
$Mu_0_1             Vapor-film interface mobility   : 5.0e-12
$Mu_1_1             Grain-boundary mobility         : 5.0e-14

@BoundaryConditions
$BC0X   X axis beginning boundary condition         : Periodic
$BCNX   X axis far end boundary condition           : Periodic
$BC0Y   Y axis beginning boundary condition         : NoFlux
$BCNY   Y axis far end boundary condition           : NoFlux
$BC0Z   Z axis beginning boundary condition         : NoFlux
$BCNZ   Z axis far end boundary condition           : NoFlux
